 꽉참 → Minor GC → 살아남으면 Survivor로\nSurvivor에서 오래 버팀 → Old Generation으로 이동\nOld Generation 꽉참 → Major GC (STW 발생)"},{"t":"e"}],"l":""},"c":[]}}}}},"role":"reader"}},"82361cbf-cb03-405d-a016-484a9be1385b":{"value":{"value":{"id":"82361cbf-cb03-405d-a016-484a9be1385b","version":3,"type":"text","properties":{"title":[["GC가 실행될 때 \"Stop The World(STW)\"가 발생한다. GC 스레드 외 모든 스레드가 잠시 멈춘다. Major GC는 STW 시간이 길어서 서버 응답 지연이 생길 수 있다."]]},"created_time":1783922499790,"last_edited_time":1783922499790,"parent_id":"39c23329-f081-81cf-b60f-d3aa32ad8433","parent_table":"block","alive":true,"space_id":"42226e73-10fb-44ef-86b2-97a01d83a329","crdt_format_version":1,"crdt_data":{"title":{"r":"ooEH9GGPJzgZWUtvsv5JqQ,\"start\",\"end\"","n":{"ooEH9GGPJzgZWUtvsv5JqQ,\"start\",\"end\"":{"s":{"x":"ooEH9GGPJzgZWUtvsv5JqQ","i":[{"t":"s"},{"t":"t","i":["ANUdO8r1QSJb",1],"o":"start","l":104,"c":"GC가 실행될 때 \"Stop The World(STW)\"가 발생한다. GC 스레드 외 모든 스레드가 잠시 멈춘다. Major GC는 STW 시간이 길어서 서버 응답 지연이 생길 수 있다."},{"t":"e"}],"l":""},"c":[]}}}}},"role":"reader"}},"a32fe879-44ce-4614-bc8d-da27ad9423a2":{"value":{"value":{"id":"a32fe879-44ce-4614-bc8d-da27ad9423a2","version":2,"type":"divider","created_time":1783922499791,"last_edited_time":1783922499791,"parent_id":"39c23329-f081-81cf-b60f-d3aa32ad8433","parent_table":"block","alive":true,"space_id":"42226e73-10fb-44ef-86b2-97a01d83a329","crdt_format_version":1,"crdt_data":{"title":{"r":"s-nxHjPbUmKWffCYxHeWGA,\"start\",\"end\"","n":{"s-nxHjPbUmKWffCYxHeWGA,\"start\",\"end\"":{"s":{"x":"s-nxHjPbUmKWffCYxHeWGA","i":[{"t":"s"},{"t":"e"}],"l":""},"c":[]}}}}},"role":"reader"}},"6c17faf3-43f3-4864-9c17-06d0f26990fd":{"value":{"value":{"id":"6c17faf3-43f3-4864-9c17-06d0f26990fd","version":3,"type":"sub_header","properties":{"title":[["Checked vs Unchecked 예외"]]},"format":{"toggleable":false},"created_time":1783922499791,"last_edited_time":1783922499791,"parent_id":"39c23329-f081-81cf-b60f-d3aa32ad8433","parent_table":"block","alive":true,"space_id":"42226e73-10fb-44ef-8